        "original_id": "26ea0733-41d0-5d89-a6e8-d4e94719b3ee",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ralph Smart, Trey Parker, Anthony Bushell\n- Works: Danger Man, Quatermass and the Pit\n- Roles: producer, director, writer, actor, animator, singer, songwriter\n\nFacts:\n- Ralph Foster Smart was born on 27 August 1908 in England to Australian parents.\n- Ralph Smart was a film and television producer, director, and writer.\n- Anthony Bushell played Colonel Breen in the BBC serial Quatermass and the Pit from 1958 to 1959.\n- Randolph Severn \"Trey\" Parker III was born on October 19, 1969.\n- Trey Parker is an American actor, animator, writer, director, producer, singer, and songwriter.\n- Ralph Smart created the television programme Danger Man and wrote many of its scripts.\n- Anthony Bushell appeared in and directed various British TV series such as Danger Man.\n- Ralph Smart died on 12 February 2001.",
